output/championgrip-co-za/site/.next/
output/championgrip-co-za/site/.env*
output/championgrip-co-za/site/public/media/champion-grip/live/
output/championgrip-co-za/site/public/media/champion-grip/generated/
output/championgrip-co-za/site/public/media/champion-grip/lifestyle/
# Prefer webp; keep logo + hero-outdoor PNG
